{"id":"n22865-1-9","stage":4,"title":"감회 · 感怀","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n22865-1-9-1","ko":"우리가 어렸을 때 자주 먹던 과자네요?","zh":"这是我们小时候经常吃的零食吧？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"우리가","meaning":"我们，咱们","explanation":"우리：我们，咱们；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17182","senseId":"1","lemma":"우리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"우리가","audio":"/audio/49bdae052f6acaf1e2d7.mp3"}},{"text":"어렸을","meaning":"年幼、年龄小","explanation":"어리다：年幼、年龄小；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；을：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"어리다","audio":"/audio/ec54bee5939613d498c9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74176","senseId":"1","lemma":"어리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어렸을","audio":"/audio/314f3a56783f02be9cd3.mp3"}},{"text":"때","meaning":"时，时候","explanation":"때：时，时候。","readings":[{"term":"때","audio":"/audio/43bc9c47e0f938b11288.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74123","senseId":"1","lemma":"때","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"때","audio":"/audio/43bc9c47e0f938b11288.mp3"}},{"text":"자주","meaning":"常常，经常","explanation":"자주：常常，经常。","readings":[{"term":"자주","audio":"/audio/604b383d216f9452c5d2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71199","senseId":"1","lemma":"자주","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"자주","audio":"/audio/604b383d216f9452c5d2.mp3"}},{"text":"먹던","meaning":"吃","explanation":"먹다：吃；던：修饰后面的名词，回想过去持续、反复或尚未完成的情况。","readings":[{"term":"먹다","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58272","senseId":"1","lemma":"먹다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"먹던","audio":"/audio/d1fa6c07fc501f3621af.mp3"}},{"text":"과자네요?","meaning":"饼干","explanation":"과자：饼干；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；네요：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，礼貌句末。","readings":[{"term":"과자","audio":"/audio/8cbae77b051c729ee93f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"18286","s